Package: com.sahinkaa.neverlowermusic16
Name: NeverLowerMusic16
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Prevents notification sounds from lowering now-playing audio on iOS 16. During playback, notification volume follows media volume.
Maintainer: sahinkaa
Author: sahinkaa
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), firmware (<< 17.0), mobilesubstrate
